%% CI/CD with parallel jobs, fail paths, and artifact promotion.
flowchart TD
  Push[git push main] --> Lint[eslint + typecheck]
  Push --> Unit[unit tests]
  Push --> Visual[verify:visual]
  Lint --> Gate{all green?}
  Unit --> Gate
  Visual --> Gate
  Gate -->|no| Fail[block merge]
  Gate -->|yes| Pack[npm pack]
  Pack --> SBOM[generate SBOM]
  Pack --> Sign[cosign sign]
  SBOM --> Rel{tag vX.Y.Z?}
  Sign --> Rel
  Rel -->|no| Snapshot[GitHub snapshot]
  Rel -->|yes| GH[GitHub Release]
  GH --> NPM[npm publish --access public]
  NPM --> Docs[deploy md-docs site]
